<title>UK: AXA $200 million seven-year Eurobond due next week.</title>
<headline>AXA $200 million seven-year Eurobond due next week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican wiring cable producer AXA is expected to launch a $200 million seven-year Eurobond next week, bankers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Chase was tipped as lead manager of the transaction. Dealers said roadshows for the deal would end this week.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
